
PostgreSQL setup:
after install: /usr/pgsql-10/bin/postgresql-10-setup initdb
To fixe this error:
psql: FATAL:  Ident authentication failed for user "ntg"
edit: /data/var/lib/pgsql/10/data/pg_hba.conf: change 'ident' to md5 and restart postgresql
local   all             all                                     md5
host    all             all             127.0.0.1/32            md5
host    all             all             ::1/128                 md5

install doc:
- python3 -m scripts.cceh.mk_user -e <email> -u <username> -p <password>
+ python3 -m scripts.cceh.mk_users -e <email> -u <username> -p <password> server/instance/_globals.conf

~/.my.cnf: add .ntg to file name
	remove ' from file
	change [ntg] to [mysql]

server/instance/<app>.conf: add MYSQL_NESTLE_TABLE='Nestle29'

run prepare.py before cbgm.py

after cd client, then make build, and then copy build contents to webserver doc location
and edit api.conf.js to point to api server
